[00:16.56]Stuck in the jetwash
[00:16.56]堵在飞机上
[00:20.22]Bad trip I couldn't get off
[00:20.22]不能离开的悲催旅途
[00:23.82]And maybe I bit off more than I could chew
[00:23.82]也许我真是太不自量力（贪多嚼不烂）
[00:27.67]And overhead of the aqua blue
[00:27.67]头顶上的是水蓝的天空
[00:32.16]Fall to your knees bring on the rapture
[00:32.16]躺在你双膝上让我欣喜若狂
[00:35.64]Blessed be the boys time can't capture
[00:35.64]希望这是没有过的男孩时间
[00:40.55]On film or between the sheets
[00:40.55]在电影院或在床单之间
[00:43.95]I always fall from your window to the pitch black streets
[00:43.95]我总是从你的窗户掉到漆黑的街道
[00:49.01]
[00:49.48]And with the black banners raised as the crooked smiles fade
[00:49.48]收起虚伪的笑容，扬起黑色的旗帜
[00:53.73]Former heroes who quit too late
[00:53.73]先前太早放弃的英雄们
[00:57.77]Just wanna fill up the trophy case again
[00:57.77]只是想将奖杯展柜再次填满
[01:03.98]
[01:05.20]And in the end
[01:05.20]然而到头来
[01:08.28]I'd do it all again
[01:08.28]我将从新再来
[01:12.34]I think you're my best friend
[01:12.34]我认为我最好的朋友是你
[01:17.27]Don't you know that the kids aren't all, kids aren't alright
[01:17.27]难道你不知道我完全，真的不OK
[01:22.74]I'll be yours
[01:22.74]我将会是你的
[01:25.38]When it rains it pours
